      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:17",
      "cellIndex": 17,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Lagrangian and Euler-Lagrange equations",
      "sourceSha256": "0c07aa7bae45ef4fcd1006c331d61ed8c296e6e6cba6191b31426d6b957c4c93",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:18",
      "cellIndex": 18,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "To show how to find the Euler-Lagrange equation including the constraint force\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q_i}} \\mathcal{L} \n- \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} \\mathcal{L}\n= \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j,\n$$\nthis time each term and the required Lagrangian will be calculated manually. Afterwards, we will keep working with functions that automate this process.",
      "sourceSha256": "ad0c889ccd1de303bbdeb34820550c7742cdde659e1a5204c814fa92c58d23d0",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q_i}} \\mathcal{L} \n- \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} \\mathcal{L}\n= \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j,\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:19",
      "cellIndex": 19,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "L = sm.Eq(sm.Symbol('\\mathcal{L}'), (T.rhs - V.rhs).simplify())\nL",
      "sourceSha256": "fe919def9a8d10f1cb114a593e3a8edcfd6c04b249c4e6c7f83a3ad0720ab1d1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "                ⎛                2  2    2⎞\n              m⋅⎝2⋅g⋅ρ⋅cos(φ) + ρ ⋅φ̇  + ρ̇ ⎠\n\\mathcal{L} = ─────────────────────────────\n                            2              ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\mathcal{L} = \\frac{m \\left(2 g \\rho \\cos{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho^{2} \\dot{\\phi}^{2} + \\dot{\\rho}^{2}\\right)}{2}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "simplify",
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.Symbol"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:20",
      "cellIndex": 20,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Generalized forces consequence of a potential:\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} \\mathcal{L} .\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "442aa9cc3fe75f562388804ccae7a2661ebd590cf62677666ff321ffbf7d1d62",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} \\mathcal{L} .\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:21",
      "cellIndex": 21,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_dq = L.rhs.diff(phi)\nrho_dq = L.rhs.diff(rho)",
      "sourceSha256": "d4a14578f3c72cd0912732d95b676f6076c2360c3544c54d1bcee34811b46369",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "L.rhs.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:22",
      "cellIndex": 22,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "The term that looks like mass times acceleration, the derivative of each $p_i$ with respect to time:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q_i}} \\mathcal{L} .\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "f1efb9fff3d65fd464ca96a28d0d32582aed0c0a786e97a70f09d948b5ed6dac",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "p_i"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q_i}} \\mathcal{L} .\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:23",
      "cellIndex": 23,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_dtdp = L.rhs.diff(phi.diff(t)).diff(t)\nrho_dtdp = L.rhs.diff(rho.diff(t)).diff(t)",
      "sourceSha256": "7fd1cc37d6307f2781dc4dcb4a54f02c4c28c19403bc6d92f1fa231f042862d6",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "L.rhs.diff",
          "diff",
          "phi.diff",
          "rho.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:24",
      "cellIndex": 24,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Generalized constraint forces:\n\n$$\nQ_i = \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j .\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "7804567d371505d6da118cc2fe2f66016a8cec4d93b40d290af23c27e68a6f54",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nQ_i = \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j .\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:25",
      "cellIndex": 25,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_Q = lambda1* f1.rhs.diff(phi)\nrho_Q = lambda1* f1.rhs.diff(rho)",
      "sourceSha256": "c6f5e6bb893512efc276851fe12643fa6f3900a057a619604d06731931daccfd",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "f1.rhs.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:26",
      "cellIndex": 26,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Merging these results, we can write the Euler-Lagrange equations that include the constraint forces.",
      "sourceSha256": "e75fa2901fd4b22d9062b14725a064cfd0a6ae8cb970d4305392f66cdd51865a",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:27",
      "cellIndex": 27,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_EL = sm.Eq(phi_dtdp - phi_dq, phi_Q) # equation set equal to zero\nphi_EL.simplify()",
      "sourceSha256": "95efe7dfd730950c1c6a98323207792e8d16b4820bf505e96bb046e68fcdc9e9",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "m⋅(g⋅sin(φ) + ρ⋅φ̈ + 2⋅φ̇⋅ρ̇)⋅ρ = 0",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle m \\left(g \\sin{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho \\ddot{\\phi} + 2 \\dot{\\phi} \\dot{\\rho}\\right) \\rho = 0$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "phi_EL.simplify",
          "sm.Eq"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:28",
      "cellIndex": 28,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "rho_EL = sm.Eq(rho_dtdp - rho_dq, rho_Q) # equation set equal to zero\nrho_EL.simplify()",
      "sourceSha256": "93c9c0625cbec9d3cc980b827fb09ac11e91d171af171547f0587f4da7b6aa57",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "       ⎛               2    ⎞\nλ₁ = m⋅⎝-g⋅cos(φ) - ρ⋅φ̇  + ρ̈⎠",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\lambda_{1} = m \\left(- g \\cos{\\left(\\phi \\right)} - \\rho \\dot{\\phi}^{2} + \\ddot{\\rho}\\right)$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
