    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:29",
      "cellIndex": 29,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Using functions",
      "sourceSha256": "bc980c4d8f7aa1eb838698e43db8bb488cac2a09da0ce977958bf9ca3d615c49",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:30",
      "cellIndex": 30,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "First, the equations without the constraint forces are calculated\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q}} \\mathcal{L} \n- \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q} \\mathcal{L} \n= 0\n$$",
      "sourceSha256": "0788eb7985316595df4fee23d9864b65053044051aeda1655a2046b7f05720d6",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t} \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\dot{q}} \\mathcal{L} \n- \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q} \\mathcal{L} \n= 0\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:31",
      "cellIndex": 31,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "def eulerLagrange(T, V, coordinateGeneralized):\n    '''    \n    Provides the Euler-Lagrange equation for one generalized coordinate starting from the energies.\n    \n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    T : Sympy Equality (sympy.core.relational.Equality)\n        The kinetic energy of the system is explicit on the right-hand side, as a function of the generalized coordinates and velocities, and time.\n    V : Igualdad Sympy (sympy.core.relational.Equality)\n        The potential energy of the system is explicit on the right-hand side, as a function of the generalized coordinates and velocities, and time.\n    coordinateGeneralized: Sympy Symbol (sympy.core.symbol.Symbol)\n        for which we are looking the Euler-Lagrange equation\n        \n    Returns\n    -------\n    Sympy Equality (sympy.core.relational.Equality)\n        Homogeneous Euler-Lagrange equation\n    '''\n    lagrangian = (T.rhs - V.rhs).expand()\n    t = sm.Symbol('t') # since we have to differentiate respect to time, the function diff declares t as a symbol\n    return sm.Eq(\n        lagrangian.diff(coordinateGeneralized) \n        - lagrangian.diff(coordinateGeneralized.diff(t)).diff(t)\n        , 0\n    ).simplify()",
      "sourceSha256": "3ac466207caa5e0b3cbdd2f3d5ee7fe536f5ed89038b44d0817cec7033f82e02",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "coordinateGeneralized.diff",
          "diff",
          "expand",
          "lagrangian.diff",
          "simplify",
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.Symbol"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:32",
      "cellIndex": 32,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_EL = eulerLagrange(T, V, phi)\nrho_EL = eulerLagrange(T, V, rho)\nphi_EL, rho_EL",
      "sourceSha256": "5ebbdb0d2d82c2194d6b4f3a3fdccda91a88f2aab6d82f672c2544adf7e82b28",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "⎛                                    ⎛              2    ⎞    ⎞\n⎝m⋅(g⋅sin(φ) + ρ⋅φ̈ + 2⋅φ̇⋅ρ̇)⋅ρ = 0, m⋅⎝g⋅cos(φ) + ρ⋅φ̇  - ρ̈⎠ = 0⎠",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\left( m \\left(g \\sin{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho \\ddot{\\phi} + 2 \\dot{\\phi} \\dot{\\rho}\\right) \\rho = 0, \\  m \\left(g \\cos{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho \\dot{\\phi}^{2} - \\ddot{\\rho}\\right) = 0\\right)$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "eulerLagrange"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:33",
      "cellIndex": 33,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Then we add the terms with the constraint forces\n$$\nQ_i = \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j ,\n$$\nusing a negative sign because of the order given to the terms in the Euler-Lagrange equations.",
      "sourceSha256": "193f6c977588bdd3c0d8a18fd3f9b97d89eafa8a57be345f7e1e6a68dbf76e3c",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nQ_i = \\sum_j \\lambda_j(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial q_i} f_j ,\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:34",
      "cellIndex": 34,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "phi_EL = sm.Eq(phi_EL.lhs, phi_Q)\nrho_EL = sm.Eq(rho_EL.lhs, rho_Q)\nphi_EL, rho_EL",
      "sourceSha256": "454e33065d4c5c32bbdf9c072e185763652088804098478e5ed3465cf4fcb2c5",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "⎛                                    ⎛              2    ⎞     ⎞\n⎝m⋅(g⋅sin(φ) + ρ⋅φ̈ + 2⋅φ̇⋅ρ̇)⋅ρ = 0, m⋅⎝g⋅cos(φ) + ρ⋅φ̇  - ρ̈⎠ = λ₁⎠",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\left( m \\left(g \\sin{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho \\ddot{\\phi} + 2 \\dot{\\phi} \\dot{\\rho}\\right) \\rho = 0, \\  m \\left(g \\cos{\\left(\\phi \\right)} + \\rho \\dot{\\phi}^{2} - \\ddot{\\rho}\\right) = \\lambda_{1}\\right)$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:35",
      "cellIndex": 35,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Applying the constraint function",
      "sourceSha256": "79787e731f49ca927485b2a34b8feb2cbb0f30f79920f380f36cc3c6f0bb1237",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:36",
      "cellIndex": 36,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "At the Euler-Langrange equations, the radial coordinate, $\\rho$, is substituted by a constant rope length, $\\ell$, as its considered as inextensible.",
      "sourceSha256": "6cd7e9a769c04e3a2e9c373ed933bf21386cedb98fe2d593fd0afaa2daa78d87",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\rho"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\ell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:37",
      "cellIndex": 37,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "rho_f1 = sm.solve(f1.rhs, rho)[0]\nsm.Eq(rho, rho_f1)",
      "sourceSha256": "7b3acbce89108f0ce58586bb4b3d8f101c91df4cc220b5959533473c4183d327",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "ρ = \\ell",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\rho = \\ell$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "sm.solve"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:38",
      "cellIndex": 38,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "And due $\\ell$ is a constant, the time derivative of the radial coordinate, $\\dot{\\rho}$, is null.\nThe same applies to the second time derivative of the radial coordinate, $\\ddot{\\rho}$.",
      "sourceSha256": "63f1fe17a0391dc8f35ba00b7b3d88a52dfa3866768fa924bb6fdc64348543b8",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\ell"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\dot{\\rho}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\ddot{\\rho}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:39",
      "cellIndex": 39,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sm.Eq(f1.rhs.diff(t), 0)",
      "sourceSha256": "a00b0b3ed0cbe1134a645d1f58847f51327ad70885516e774a50d0f2e106c672",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "ρ̇ = 0",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\dot{\\rho} = 0$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
