    {
      "sourceRef": "index:45",
      "cellIndex": 45,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "The equations for the dynamics of $\\varphi$ is obtained from the first one:",
      "sourceSha256": "21ae5156e48cf90c2aa75d167c07c1248b515c7cae6a1ebdcab946158717e85f",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
