      "cellIndex": 47,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "From the second one, a function for $\\lambda_1$ is obtained:",
      "sourceSha256": "a9b50a1ccb6c7b7d9f3a249d6c93939686155578f20e1d60975a1a045a991da8",
      "outputs": [],
