    {
      "sourceRef": "index:49",
      "cellIndex": 49,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Since in this case\n\n$$\nQ_\\rho= \\lambda_1(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\rho} f_1 = \\lambda_1(t),\n$$\nthe expression for the constraint force exerted by the string, that is, the tension, is:",
      "sourceSha256": "7eb9d59ad2c711f961bc7f90fb776ab81a84500a302d971c73a445248ab1d6c4",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "\nQ_\\rho= \\lambda_1(t) \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\rho} f_1 = \\lambda_1(t),\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
